DATA AND SOFTWARE LICENCE RECORD

RetailRocket data

The distributed customer feature tables and purchaser timestamp table are
derived from the Retailrocket recommender system dataset published on Kaggle.
The dataset card identifies the licence as Creative Commons Attribution
NonCommercial ShareAlike 4.0 International.

Source
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/retailrocket/ecommerce-dataset

Licence
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The recorded use is noncommercial academic reproduction. Redistribution and
adaptation are governed by attribution, noncommercial and share-alike
conditions.

